---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Why Toolwise AI exists and who it is for.">
  <Prose title="About Toolwise AI" lede="Practical AI tools. Honest comparisons. Better work.">
    <p>
      Toolwise AI is an independent publication for freelancers, consultants and small teams who want to use AI tools
      sensibly in their day-to-day work. There are a lot of AI products and a lot of noise around them. We try to cut
      through it with guides that are useful, specific and honest about trade-offs.
    </p>
    <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Workflows</strong> you can follow and adapt, such as summarizing long documents or drafting proposals.</li>
      <li><strong>Comparisons</strong> built on clear criteria, with prices and plan details checked against official sources and dated.</li>
      <li><strong>Practical guidance</strong> on privacy, client confidentiality and when an AI tool isn’t worth paying for.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What you won’t find</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Invented hands-on reviews, test results, testimonials or screenshots.</li>
      <li>Rankings influenced by who pays the highest commission.</li>
      <li>Mass-produced pages that exist only to rank in search engines.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for how articles are researched and reviewed, and our
      <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for how the site is funded.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
